!Content/EnvSandbox/Materials/Masters/**

# World Partition one-file-per-actor mirror for the Monoliths levels above.
# OFPA actors live under Content/__ExternalActors__/<original package path>/,
# a separate top-level dir from Content/EnvSandbox/ -- the unignore above does
# not cover it. Without this, any actor placed in a Monoliths level (e.g. the
# Shorewake chapter's quill trigger, 2026-09-04) silently never reaches git.
!Content/__ExternalActors__/
Content/__ExternalActors__/*
!Content/__ExternalActors__/EnvSandbox/
Content/__ExternalActors__/EnvSandbox/*
!Content/__ExternalActors__/EnvSandbox/Monoliths/
